### 환경 설정
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1

### 1. 채팅방 생성 (DIRECT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chatrooms
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "roomType": "DIRECT",
  "name": null,
  "memberIds": [2]
}

### 2. 채팅방 생성 (GROUP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chatrooms
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "roomType": "GROUP",
  "name": "알고리즘 스터디",
  "memberIds": [2, 3]
}

### 3. 채팅방 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chatrooms
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 4. 읽음 처리
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/chatrooms/1/read
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "lastReadMessageId": 10
}
